.el .ds Aq '
.TH scanr-config 1  "scanr-config " 
.SH NAME
scanr\-config \- Inspect and manage configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBscanr\-config\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect and manage configuration
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
scanr\-config\-init(1)
Write an annotated scanr.toml documenting every field
.TP
scanr\-config\-show(1)
Show the merged configuration
.TP
scanr\-config\-validate(1)
Check configuration without running anything
.TP
scanr\-config\-path(1)
Show which configuration files were discovered
.TP
scanr\-config\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
